<!--
  This app id belongs to the demo app only.

  It deliberately lives here rather than in the library: a library-owned `ad_mob_app_id` is
  inherited by every consumer app that does not declare a resource with the exact same name, which
  silently points both the UMP consent request and MobileAds.initialize at the demo app's publisher
  account. The manifest `com.google.android.gms.ads.APPLICATION_ID` meta-data is the single source
  of truth, and the toolkit reads it from there.
-->
